<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Efesa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Efesa Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="rem">Drafted in 2015. 2016. Advisor check with Wabele, Jack, Yobe and Dickson and Anne, March 2017. Village check in May/June 2017. Village check corrections by Antonia Alberts and Anne Stoppels, Nov 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">Final advisor check in Oct 2019</para>
  <para style="mt">Efesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Efesa Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo e dibolo ligia, sese idele inolofea eweguba asigimesisia, sowi ewe seleba mebailu. Godehe hebenene kegele suniada, helefealune kegele suniada, gagaiyoba ofasia, Keliso E sisa diba ufia melesi hamefe. Ausimo, Keliso E-mo, kegele suniane yasilomo, E koleba labe. (Efesa 1.10 ami bamale.) Aufia, Godehe Ene idele inolomo, Kelisodai koleba kulifia ligia, hilise ule koleba melesi hamefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe sowi ewene haisi nolobalomo, eweguba selelu. Gode Ene kanululo amohe, idele inolo Keliso labea uluba dibia inigia, ua mesesi ifoba ofelefe. Keliso Ehe dabalu mololu amo alefasia, Godehe Ene idele inolo sunia Ene obegeba gasiba dafelagoba dulu. Aufia, Ene Asubane Noekenemo ilifea mesiamo, Ehe idele inolo amo enaoba ofelefe. (Efesa 1.13 ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, Folohe sulu haisi aganebo amo selesiamo, sigidubulu idele inolomo Yesufea kukulifia labe. Idele inolo Kelisofea kukulife ili amo, mosomu ule labe. Aufia, Godene idele inolomo domala ule labe. Domala amone gunimo, Keliso labe. (Efesa 4.4-16 ami bamale.) Aufia, Godene idele inolo ili amo molo ule labe. Keliso E-mo, molo amone duguiya ikau kolelumo, E labe. (Efesa 2.20-22 ami bamale.) Aufia, Godefea asigi ule ufulu ili amo, idogulu labe. Ido amone ainomo, Keliso labe. (Efesa 5.22-32 ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Aulugulu, sowi selelu iwimo, Godehe Ene idele inolofea nafulu kegele moloyoba solumo ewe. Keliso Ene hameselo ulu melumo alefasia, nine wolu heeba dafulu. Amo alefasia, ninihe Ene kanululomo sunia ulufa bosolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">HD 18.19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19.1</ref></char>
    </note>Na <char style="w">Folo</char>. Gode Ene hame alefasia na iminilugulu, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ulenomo, na lolu. Nahe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Sowi ewe, sigidubulu idele inolo Efesa dauno alebaibu gili amofea seleba mesu. Gili Keliso Yesufea kulifia, Efea asigi ule ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> alebaibu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nine Nao Godedai, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Asubane edililo kegele nafulu Yesu Kelisofea alefasia ninifea melu dobu</para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:6">Efe 2.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ninihe Nao Gode wi digiyoba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:3">E nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone Enao ligia, Gode labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:3">Ehe Kelisofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:3">
    <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> kiwigagalu usu ami, <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> sunia ninifea melumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:3">nine asubane sagoba ofelesia aulu.<verse eid="EPH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4-5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4-5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yon 1.12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:16">15.16</ref></char>
    </note>Maumo, helefealuda aso molobale ligia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">Gode alefasia nini molobebelelu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">Ninimo, Efea kulifia ligia, Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> ligia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">nini Ene si saabia heleba daaluda male melesi, Ehe auba aulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:4-5" />
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">Amakele waagifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">Ehe nini bule koleba hamesefia, Yesu Keliso alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">ninimo, Ene fofoba dulu faibili uluba diyone daiyasia, molobebelelu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:4-5">Ene hame alefasia, Godehe auba heafuba mololu.<verse eid="EPH 1:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ehe Ene Hameselu Faibe alefasia, ninifea auba kanululu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:6">Ausi, nini Ene fofoba dulu faibili ligia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:6">ninihe Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana ewe hilisesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:6">Ene wi wabialeba digima.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:7">Efe 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1.14</ref></char>
    </note>Godene kanululomo, Efea wasiga sauulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:7">Aulune, Ene Faibene ibi alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:7">Ehe nine wolumo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galisia</char>,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:7">nini sububa dafelagolu.<verse eid="EPH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Godehe Ene kanululomo bule koleba galebaisasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:8">ninifea sagaba selu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:8">Ausiamo, Ehe dawalolodai, asigi nafuludai, ninifea melu.<verse eid="EPH 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:25">Lom 16.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amakele waagifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:9">Godehe dabalu, E Kelisofea alefasia moloyo hamefemo, daiyaba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:9">Aufia, Ehe Ene hame amone mugusilu ufulumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:9">aga heafusia, ninifea ulufaba walelu.<verse eid="EPH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1.16</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:20">20</ref></char>
    </note>E moloyo daiyalumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">
    <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> kegeleda, helefealune kegeleda, sunia gagaiyofia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">ua ule melesi gegoaba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">Aufia, kegele amo sunia Kelisofea kuliba ofelesi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">E suniane guni adesia, yasilo miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">Fogo Ene iminiba ufulumo wakaliba sugasi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:10">daiyalu amo moloba dafelagoyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:28-29">Lom 8.28-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gode ehe Ene hamedai, asigidai, kuliba abia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:11">kegele sunia moloba dafelagolo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:11" />
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:11">Amakele waagifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:11">Ehe nini molobebelelumo, nini Kelisofea kulifia adesi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:11">Ene daalo diyone idele inolo alebaimesi iminiba ufulu.<verse eid="EPH 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ehe nini Ene elalelu amofea wabialesia, Ene wi digiba samesi aulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:12">Hameda Kelisofea maugaba diba ofogofia yasiba alolu amo, nini lolu.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoyone</char> awalu sulu nafulu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">sulu seale amo dobelesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">gilida Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:13" />
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">Asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">Godehe Ene oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo kuliba abia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">
    <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amo gilifea meyoba solu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">Ehe gilifea Asubane amo mesiamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:13">gili Ene koleba iminisia, Ene-ba enaoba ufulu.<verse eid="EPH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 1:22">2Kld 1.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asubane Noekene ninifea ama enaosia mefia labe ewemo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">nine Naone daalo kegele sunia seale diyobasuba, nini fadaba asigifia lolu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:14" />
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">Asubane amo alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">nini hilisesia, Godehe nini gasiba dafelagoba dulune,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">nini Ene faibili alebaisuba asigibu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">Ausia, ninihe Ene elalelu amofea wabialesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 1:14">Ene wi digiba saeyoba.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Efesa ilifea dawalolo memesi Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Gilihe Saminilo Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluba</char> solumoda, aufia, gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Gode Ene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ili amo suniafea hamesefia alebaibuba solumoda, na dubulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />Aulugulu, fogo na <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, hilia sunia na gili asigisia, Godefea henelu sulu saeyone kalugaabale selabasu ado.<verse eid="EPH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:9">Kol 1.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na auba Godedai selesiamo, Ehe Asubane Noekene alefasia, gilifea dawalolo mesia, kegele muguba ufulu amo ulufaba homesi, na Efea sodo. Ausihe, gili E fadaba asigifiasu miliyobafe. E nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone Gode ligia, nine Nao <char style="w">elalelu</char> labe. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Aufia, na Efea haalisiamo, gine asigi sawaba bamesine, Ehe gine si enaeda moloba homesi, na haaliba lolu. Ausi, gili diyo kegele babiyobafe. Godehe gili welumo, kegele amo dimesifia welu. Kegele ewe, gili diyone gine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifia</char> alebaibu amo. Ausi, auba dawalosia, gilihe Ene daalo meyoba saaba ufulu kegele, elalelu wasiga sauulumo babiyobafe. Daalo kegele amo, Godehe ene muuba kalilu idele inolo ili amosu dimesi iminiba ufulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19-20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:4">2Kld 13.4</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, gili Ene kiwigagalu momolelu bule iminiyodoluale halagulubiba hiliseyobafe. Kiwigagalu alefasia, Godehe, Keliso amo daneba yaalu dobiafia degeba ifofia, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> kiwigagalu usu ami, Ene sone lilibefealo yoba mesesi gadefalu. Aufia, gili eweguba hiliseyobafe. Ene kiwigagalu ule hamaga alefasia, Ehe <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ninifea dabalu kolelu moloba labeba hiliseyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 1:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:10">2.10</ref></char>
    </note>Ana lagi yoba sigiamo, Keliso Ehe, yasilo suniada, kiwigagalu suniada, guni inolo suniada, kiwida dobu kegele suniada, wida solu suniada, ine mana wasolu koleba ligia, sunia gasiagufia yasibu. Agasuale. Dufiada aubasu moloyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sng 8.6</ref></char></note>Aulune, Godehe kegele sunia amo Ene emo sisa ofasia, E kegele suniane guni melesi gadefalu. Mana amo alefasia, E <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesene</char> guni labe. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:10">Efe 4.10</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:5">Lom 12.5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1.18</ref></char></note>Sese amo Ene domala. Ehe sese wasigaaba ofelefe. Aubasu, Ehe kegele suniada wasiga sauuba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Godehe nini idele inolo daneba yaalumo, Kelisodai degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:21">Kol 1.21</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:13">2.13</ref></char>
    </note>Samini, gilimo, heleba dedaleba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololabiasu milibaiba labi, gili daneba yaafia alolu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:7">Kol 3.7</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:3">Dai 3.3</ref></char></note>Fogo amimo, gilihe anakiwine kiwigagalu amone yasife amo kuliba dedalesia, helefealu ewene wolu mana kuliba dedaleba alolu. Yasilo amohe, aga suluda saidafolo ili amone libofea dabalu moloba ofolaba labe. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:6">Kol 3.6</ref></char></note>Samini, nini suniada mosomu amo galiba ligia, ninihe <char style="w">helefealune huu</char> amone hameda, asigida, kuliba dedalesia, amone mana molobaiyesia, gogagogaba ligia, moloba dafelagolo. Idele inolo nooloda sunia hamagulu ligia, ninida wolufealo seba dulu alebailune, gadilone usu alebailu.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4-5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.4-5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:11-13">Lom 6.11-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale, nini heleba daalu fealomo, nini daneba yaalu alolu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululoda</char> wasiga sauulu Gode amo Ehe, nini bule hameseba yaasia, ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char> bebea melesi molofia gadefalu. Seale, Ene kanululomohe, gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diaba</char> yaalu. <verse eid="EPH 2:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, Godehe nini Kelisodai ua degeba ifofasia, ninimo Keliso Yesu galiba ua <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> kiwigagalu usu ami yoba mesalu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ehe ninifea auba heafuba mololu amo alefasia, Ene kanululo ulufaba walelu. Fogo aso miyobafea ami, Ene kanululo wasiga sauulu amo ulufaba waleyobafe. Ene kanululo amo iminiyo elo male koleba.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Gilihe Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> alefasia, Gode Ene kanululo amohe gili gasiba dafelagoba dulu. Amo gili gine mololuale. Aubale. Godehe gilifea ulu mesia mololu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:29-31">1Kld 1.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:9">2Dim 1.9</ref></char></note>Gine mana nafulu mololu amo alefasiale. Ulenoda bamabamamesialene aulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:14">Dai 2.14</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Gode Ehe, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, nini dabalu nafulu molomesifia, nini hili idele inolo molofia gadefabu. Dabalu nafulu amo, Godehe nini mololabia daaba melesine, samini waagifia nineba madeneba ufulu.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosomu aida gisa alolumo Kelisohe seloaba ofelesia, ule moloba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Saminimo, gili Yudane mosomu usu seba dibale alebaisia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> alebailu. Yuda inolo ilihe, inolone <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelomo</char>, gili hilisebu. Aulugulu, badoda gelelo Yuda ilihe, yau inolomo, <char style="it">bado geleluale inolo</char>ba sodo. Bado amaleba gelelo amomo, inolo sonehe domalafea moloba ofolo kegele. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:21">Kol 1.21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:4">Lom 9.4</ref></char></note>Asigiba obegema. Fogo amimo, gili Kelisodai adale ligia, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomudai kulibale ligia, yau alebaifia alolu. Godehe Isolaeledai <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> moloyoba saaba ufulu amodai, gili gegoasiale, amone faisalo ami, gili alebaifia alolu. Gili helefealu iwi ligiamo, gili dufia kegele nafulu holobagaeyobafemo <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasibale</char> ligia, gili Gode hilisebale iwi alebailu. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1.20</ref></char></note>Auluso, samini hago alolu gilimo, aga Keliso Yesune ibi alefasia hagoaleba lubia milibailu labe.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:13">1Kld 12.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enebamo, Keliso Ene E nine Seloaba Ofolo labe. E alefasia, mosomu aidamo ua ule melesi seloaba ufulu. Saminimo, Isolaele ilidai, yau mosomudaimo, osolaba dafasia, yala ufulu alolu. Auluso, Keliso Ehe gisane yala amo hogolasia bidiba dafulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2.14</ref></char></note>Ene domalafea alefasia, Ehe Mosesene sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulida</char>, amone molomaba kiwigaaba ofoloda, sunia weaseba dafelesia afolu. Auba ausia, Ehe mosomu aida seloaba ofelesia, aida amofea inolo ule moloba ufiyo hamelu. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1.20</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:22">22</ref></char></note>Aida auba gegoafia, inolo ule moloba ofasia, Ehe aalu Ene <char style="w">imolane</char> alefasia, Godedai haiba hilise ule melesi gadefaba ufulu. Imolane amo alefasia, Ehe aine gisa alolu mana amo dufa kalolu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ais 57.19</ref></char></note>E inigia, sulu walesiamo, gili hago labefeada, ili hagoale labefeada, “Na seloaba ufiyone muluba” walelu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Enebamo, Efea alefasia, nini ninifaba <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> ule amo alefasia, Nao labea malesi eno sogoba ufulu dobu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso idele inolo, nini sunia Godene molo seale koleba lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 3:6">Efe 3.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili aga saabia no sibaisaba ligia, heleda male ligia, yau mosomu alebaibuale. Aubale. Agamo, gili <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> amodai ua gegoafia, ine mosomu usu alebaibu. Gili aga Godene damene ule koleba alebaibu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sng 118.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:42">Mad 21.42</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:11">1Kld 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref> </char></note>Gilimo, Godene molo dulu amogulu labe. <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibaisi daaluda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">saaba ofoloda</char>, ine sulumo, molo amone i kau geba ufulu dobu. Sigidubulu idele inolomo, molo amone ele labe. Aufia, Keliso Yesumo, molo amone duguiya ikau molo sunia seba adomo, E labe. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kld 3.16</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, molo amone elemo, Kelisofea kulifia labi, nafuluba fedoba seba yaabu. Ausi, molo amo diabia abia, bulesia, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> ene <char style="w">Sebele Molo</char> muuba kalilu holobagagafe. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:5">1Fid 2.5</ref></char></note>Aufia, Kelisofea alefasia, gilida auba ua kukuliba difasia, molo amo holobagagasi, Gode E molo usu ami, Ene Asubanefea labe.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Godene mugusilu ulufaba fisigaba ufia labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 1:7">Fil 1.7</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 1:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>Mau amo alefasia, Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune dabalu molosia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> gilifea walelu amo alefasia, na dibolo lolu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:25">Kol 1.25</ref></char></note>Dabalu Godehe nafea melumo, gili dubulubu. Amo ewe, Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> Ehe nafea melumo, gilifea sagamesine gadefalu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:9-10">Efe 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1.26</ref></char></note>Kegele amo ewe. Godehe Ene mugusilu muguba ufulumo, nafea ulufaba waleso. Amone na lagi ama wedino seleba ufulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Aufia, gili sulu ewe alegasiamo, eweguba asigimale. Na-mo Kelisone mugusilumo bisigia, na dawalolo dulu loluba hilisemale. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Saladegelu idele inolo adabia dedalelumo, ilifea Godene mugusilu amogubada ulufaba fisigaba waleluale. Aubale. Auluso, sedalele yagi, Godene Asubanefea alefasia, mugusilu amo Godene <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> ilifeada, Ene <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ilifeada, ulufaba fisigaba ufia labe.<verse eid="EPH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:13">Efe 2.13</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:16-19">16-19</ref></char>
    </note>Mugusilu amone elemo ewe. Awalu sulu nafulu ewefea alefasia, yau mosomu gilida, nini Isolaele galiba, domala ule ua adesia kulifia, daalo ule ua diaba yaalo alebaibu. Aufia, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, nini suniamo, kegele nini diyobafeba, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo, ua osolaba diaba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:25">Kol 1.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe na awalu sulu nafulu ewene samesi, nafea Ene kanululo balu meba ilogoso. Aufia, ehe na dabalu amo molomesi kiwigaaba ofeleso. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:9-10">1Kld 15.9-10</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu ili</char> amone, sia ageledenomo, na lolu. Auluso, Gode alefasia, na dabalu molomesi nafea kanululo meba ilogoso. Dabalu amo ewe. Na yau idele inolofea awalu sulu nafulu saaba meyo. Amo alefasia, ilida Kelisone iminiyodoluale wasiga sauulu dobumo babiyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Aufia, Godehe Ene mugusilumo idele inolo suniane asigi sawaba walemesine, na gadefaso. Mugusilu amo, Gode kegele suniada mololu amo Ehe, fogo wedinale muguba ufiasu adabia mulu.<verse eid="EPH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Godehe eweguba holobagamesi asigifia alolumo ewe. Aga Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesefea</char> alefasia, Ene dawalolone fofagelu nolobalo nolobaloba dobu amone, ulufaba waleyo hamefe. Amofea alefasia, yasiloda, wida solu ilida, anakiwine kiwigagalu usu ami alebaibu ili amohe, Godene dawalolo amo sawaba bamesi, E auba hamefe. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Asigi sisa amo Ene hamefeafia mulu. Samini waagifia, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Keliso Yesufea alefasia, auba moloyoba daiyalu hame amo ufiasu alolu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:6">Yon 14.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:2">Lom 5.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, ninihe, Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amo alefasia, nini muuba kalilu ligia, Gode Ene olegia kalugaeyomo sagilibuale. Nini Gode labea maiyone, Keliso E-mo eno labe. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Aulune, gine asigi ule ufulu ogo bonesia kiwi sanemabiyo. Higinilu na disu ewe, na gili sagoba ofelesia disu. Aulugulu, keleba asigimabiyo. Gili <char style="w">elalelu</char> ligia, heafuba alebaimesine, na higinilu ewe disu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili kiwigaaba melesi Folohe Godedai sulu saabia solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Mau amo alefasia, na emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, Nao Godedai sulu sodo. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />E-mo, <char style="w">hebene</char> alebaibu sunia amoneda, helefealu alebaibu sunia amoneda, ine Enao labi, sunia Efeafia misiyone wi dilo. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Na emo hugulumo sagafia, Edai sulu selesiamo, Ehe Ene Asubanefea alefasia, Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> wasiga sauulu amifia, gine libo wasigafia, gili kiwigaaba homesi selesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yon 14.23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:23">Kol 1.23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:7">2.7</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogo alefasia, Keliso E gine libo usu melesine, na aubada selesu. Ausimo, gili hameselo mana usu ami, i seme hele usu fedoba sebuguba, molo ikau hele usu geluguba, kiwigaaba kalugaafia alebaiyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Ausimo, gilida, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu ili noolo suniadai</char>, ua gegoaba ligia, Kelisone hameselomo eloba bisigia, amo asigiba diyodolu alebaiba yaeyobafe. Hameselo amone selaleda, fubada, lagoloda, ilogoloda, gili ua asigiba diaba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Ene hameselohe nine asigi wasolu amo, gili asigiba diaba yaeyobafe. Ausi, Gode Enefea wasiga sauulu iminibu amogubasu, gilifeada auba wasiga sauuyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nini amene haalisumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">amene asigisumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">amone E suniaba daaba</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">moloyodolu labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">Ene kiwigagalu amohe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">nine libo usu dabalu molofe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">Amone bisigia, nini koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">Ene kiwigagalu eloyo amonemo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">beabia abia samodoyodoluale</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:20">loluba bosolu.<verse eid="EPH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Aulune, Ene wi amo digimale!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 3:21" />
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">Keliso Yesu Efea alefasiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">ene <char style="w">sese</char> amofea alefasiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">nini koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">Godene wi digibasu miliyoba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">Saladegelu aselabia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">mulufealoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">maiyofealoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">amo suniahe aubasu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">Godene wi digibasu miliyo dobu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo</char>, Efea alefalu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="EPH 3:21">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>
    </char>. Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Keliso idele inolo ninimo, Kelisone domala lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:10">Kol 1.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na Folo, na dibolo lolu ewene maumo, na <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> dabalu molobasu ado. Na gilifea koleba selesumo ewe. Godehe gili welubasi, gilida welu idele inolo anoguba daabasu melale. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kol 3.12-13</ref></char></note>Amo eweguba. Gili koleba esebalo, helea hamedofa ligia, gine meleba no anogone mana habosiale, waagimasia hameseba melale. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:14-15">Kol 3.14-15</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char>, gili <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> ua melesi dofaba ofelefe. Aulugulu, hilise ule ufiyone mana amo fedoba seyone hogololu dabalu moloba melale.<verse eid="EPH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Domalamo ule labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:4">Asubanemo ule labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EPH 4:4">Amogubasu, Godehe gili welumo, Ehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame ule diba ofogofia yasiba</char> melesine welu.<verse eid="EPH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Aufia, Saminilomo ule labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:5">
    <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ofolo</char> manamo ule dobu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:5">
    <char style="w">Hano gelo</char> manamo ule dobu.<verse eid="EPH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:6">1Kld 12.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Suniane Enaomo, Gode ule labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:6">E suniane sunialu labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:6">Aufia, Ehe suniafea dabalu mololo labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EPH 4:6">Aufia, E kegele suniane usu labe.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:3">Lom 12.3</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 12:6">6</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> ene hame kuliba abia, Ehe <char style="w">kanululo</char> nini elebi elebibafea meba ilogolu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Sng 68.18</ref></char></note>Godene bugo amone iminiba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 4:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">E-mo ana fela abiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">E kaamo adesia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Ene gisa dofaba anagolofia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">luba dibia abia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">ulu kegele idele inolofea sagaba waalelu.</char><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:13">Yon 3.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Baibolo bugo selesia, “E <char style="it">ana fela abiamo</char>ba” selefe ewe, balu selefale. Aubale. Sulu ewe selesia, “Maugabamo E helefealu iwidale suga daalububa” selesia aufe.<verse eid="EPH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Inolo maugaba suga daalu amo hamagane fela daalu amo, E koleba. Fela daalu amo, E sunia aleba ililiyosia, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagoda sunia waseba suniafia felalu. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:28">1Kld 12.28</ref></char></note>Amo Ehe ulu kegele auba meba yaasiamo, eweguba ulu melu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 4:11" />
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 4:11">Noolofeamo, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> melesi melu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 4:11">Aufia, noolofeamo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> melesi melu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 4:11">Aufia, noolofeamo, awalu sulu nafulu selabia silo melesi melu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 4:11">Aufia, noolofeamo, faseda melesi melu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 4:11">Aufia, noolofeamo, walelo melesi melu.<verse eid="EPH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ehe ilifea auba ulu meba yaalu amo, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Ene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> amo kiwigaamesifia melu. Idele inolo amo auba kiwigaafia ligia, ilihe noolo sagoba ufiyone dabalu molomesifia aulu. Kelisone domalamo, auba kiwigaaba adesia nafulu melesi aulu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:28">Kol 1.28</ref></char></note>Dabalu ewemo auba mololabia daaba ligiasu, nini asigi ule ofolofealomo hilise ule ligia, Godene Faibe amoba fadaba asigisia, nine asigifealomo asidalu adesia, ninihe Keliso Efea wasiga sauufia labe imini amone eloa goasi, eloyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ausi, nini faibe subobo haiba lolualene, hano fufulesi, haiba asogolo maiyo, ilogolo maiyoba miliyobafale. Aufia, masega walefe amone fufulo nokene nokeneba fuusi, haiba ewelo asogoloba fuuba miliyobafale. Ausi, noolohe nini haiba asigi sigisia, yogoleba daafa gegeyobafale. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:19">2.19</ref></char></note>Aubale. Nini koleba noolo anogofea hamesebasu ligia, seale sulu sodo fedoba sefia ligia, kegele suniafealomo, Keliso Efea sobolabia felaeyobafe. Keliso amo, E nine guni labe. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Efea alefasia domala sunia sobofe. Auba sobosiamo, moma nonoba amone sagoba ofelesia, domalafea kukuliba yaasia, amo seba yaafe. Ausi, domalane haisi haisiba, ene eneba dabalu molosia, domala amo sobosia, hameselo manafea alefasia, kiwigaasia bulelo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili mana hili amone kuliba daaba moloba miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:14">1Fid 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:21">Lom 1.21</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, nahe Saminilone wi alefasia, sulu uleno gilifea eweguba kiwigaaba selesu. Asigi ule ufuluale idele inolohe, asigi eleda male ligia, moloba adoguba, gilida auba haiba mololabia dedaleba melabiyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ine hiliselomo nigiligagalu dobu. Ili asigilo male koleba alefasia, ine libo kaafia alebaibune, ili Godene miliyolu amone faisafealo alebaibu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Aulune, ine asigi koleba disia, eloba babiyodoluale adesia, ilihe ine meleba sefia, libo degelo mana amone sone saabia ofolo. Ausi, mana nugumalu nokene nokeneba molobaiyesia, gogagogabasu ligia, asigume ado. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Auluso, ili auba molologuba molosiale, gilimo, no alebaibu. Gilihe Keliso fadaba asigifia labe.<verse eid="EPH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Na hilisesia, gili Ene sulu dubuluba hilisesu. Aufia, seale sulu sodo Yesufea dobumo, gilifea walesi, gili dulubiyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:13">Lom 8.13</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3.9</ref></char></note>Gilifea walelumo no, ewe. Gogagogaba ado mana woluhe, inolo gegesi, e woba dafiyofealo ano. Aulugulu, gilihe, mana amakelelufealo mololo inolo gine miliyo usu labe amo, fagulo kaide huba dafologuba, hufasia saidafalimale. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Lom 12.2</ref></char></note>Walelumo no, ewe. Gine asigida, asubaneda, ogo nolofia, hili holobagagaba melale. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Stt 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3.10</ref></char></note>Aufia, gilihe inolo hili amo, fagulo hili saligaloguba, gine miliyo usu saligamale. Inolo hili amo, Godehe Ene waagulu sealeba isolu <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kalilu noekene</char> melesi moloba ufulu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:8-9">Kol 3.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Sek 8.16</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili koleba masega manamo huba dafalima. <char style="qt">Gili koleba, gine geleba no anogofea seale sulusu selaba melale.</char> Mau enebamo, nini sunia domala ulene haisi haisiba lolu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Sng 4.4</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:19-20">Yem 1.19-20</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, <char style="qt">gine libo ogo gadisenaga, amo gili nafuluba. Gili wolu mololosi.</char> Halo aso sugabale labi, gili gadilu ufia alolu amo, hamagi elomale. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" /><char style="w" lemma="Henane">Henanene</char> emo ami emelaeyo anosi, gilihe efea fogo wedinoda waagi memabiyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Gili aleba abehe, samini fadilo inolo alolumo, ga saabia no fa dimabiyo. Aubale. Aga ga koleba, dabalu moloyo dobu. Ga koleba, dabalu nafulu ge sone auba molosenaga, kegele ga molosia dife amo, osolafia, weagulu alebaibufeada meyodolu miliyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:6">Kol 4.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu sesenelu nonoba saaba dafelagomesi, gili koleba gine mofeyofea waagi fogo memabiyo. Aubale. Sulu nafulusu gine mofeyo saaba dafelagosi, inolo kiwi sanelu labemo kiwigaaba homesi saamale. Sulu amogulu selesi dobelesia, ili amo sagoba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Ais 63.10</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:19">1Des 5.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:13-14">Efe 1.13-14</ref></char></note>Aufia, gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekene</char> higinimesi moloba homabiyo. Enebamo, Godehe Asubane Noekene gilifea melu amo alefasia, gili enaobu. Enaoba ufulu amofea alefasia, gili sububa dafelagoyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:8">Kol 3.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gine libohe kabilo manada, kanoloda, gadiloda, mofe baleleba sododa, saaba duduba sododa, gine mana wolu amogulumo koleba dibia saidafalimale. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mad 6.14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:22-35">18.22-35</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kol 3.12-13</ref></char></note>Gili koleba, gine gelebafea onaba ligia, hamedufulu melale. Aufia, Godehe, Yesu Kelisone wi saabia, gine wolu mololu hamasia, heesia galiluguba, gilida aubasu, gine geleba, none wolu mololumo hamasia galibasu melale.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nini yane usu daaba miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mad 5.48</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili Godene hameselu faibe koleba alebaibu. Aulugulu, gili koleba, Ene mimisililu melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:10">Hib 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kis 29.18</ref></char></note>Auba ligiamo, eweguba hilisemale. <char style="w">Keliso</char> E koleba, gilifea hamesesia, Ene miliyolu weasesia, Godefea ulu melumo kasineda nafulu meba lagolu. Ehe gilifea auba hameseluguba, gilida no anogofea aubasu hameselabia dedaleba melale.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Susuguda, mana nugumaluda, balaliloda, mana amone wedideno ulenoda, gilidai melesi waagi gadefamabiyo. Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ilihe, mana amogulu mololale. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Aufia, soaneba sulu sododa, diba galiba sulu sododa, dedailu sulu sododa, yuasiale sulu sodo mana amo, gilidai melesi waagi gadefamabiyo. Enebamo, sulu amogulu sodomo, muuba kaliluale koleba dobolo. Auluso, sulu amogulu selesiale, gili koleba Godefea henelu sulu saamale.<verse eid="EPH 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:9-10">1Kld 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3.5</ref></char>
    </note>Gili koleba ewene eweguba fadaba hilisemale. Susugu mololoda, aufia mana nugumalu mololo amoda, balaliba adoda ili amogulu molofe damenemo ulenoda, Kelisodai, Godedai, yasifia luba ligia, Saminilo ada amone daalo diyobafale. Balalilo inolo e, masega godefea gulugululo inolo amone labe.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:4">Kol 2.4</ref>, <ref loc="COL 2:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:18">Lom 1.18</ref></char>
    </note>Gili koleba nafuluba yasimale. Ulenohe gilifea sulu eleda male selesia, gegefia, luba dibia anosi. Enebamo, mana saabia lagi solu amo molosi, Godene gadilo nokenemo, sulu saidafelefe mosomu amofeamo holobagafe. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Aulugulu, gili idele inolo amogulumodai, gegoaba ua melabiyo.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:13">Efe 2.13</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:13">Kol 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Fid 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:36">Yon 12.36</ref></char>
    </note>Saminimo, gili nigiligagalu aloluso, aga <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> alefasia, gilimo yane alebaibu. Aulugulu, gili yanene faibili daaba adoguba, dedaleba melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Yane amohe, sebe nafulu helesiamo, nafulu manada, isolu manada, seale sodo manada, helelelo. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Gili koleba, mana Saminilohe hamefe amone osolaba beaba melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Gilimo nigiligagalu mana molofe amodai, sesamaba melabiyo. Aubale. Gilihe mana amogulumo ulufaba homale. Mana amogulumohe sebe heleleba dafelagolale. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Mana ili muguba mololo amone, nini saeyale. Aubale. Nini mana amogulu saeyomo yuafe. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:20-21">Yon 3.20-21</ref></char></note>Auluso, kegele sunia yane ulufaba waalesimo, idele inolo sunia ulufa babiyobafe. Enebamo, kegele sunia ulufaba bamesi moloba ofolo amomo, yane. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">Ais 26.19</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:11">Lom 13.11</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, sulu ewe dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 5:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">
    <char style="qt">Aga hanefia labe ga, si kolafia mela.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">
    <char style="qt">Ga daneba yaalu dobiafia, degema!</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">
    <char style="qt">Ausi, Kelisohe gafea neeba doweyobafe.</char><verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili koleba, gilida aafea ugi abiamo, nafuluba luba adabia malale. Gili inolo asigida male amogulu daaba melabiyo. Aubale. Gili koleba inolo asigida ufulugulu daaba melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Agamo, Gode ene mana moloyone, gili fogo dobu. Auluso, fogo aga ninida lolu ewe, fogo wolu. Aulugulu, gili nafuluba yasiba melale. Fogo amo balu weaselosi.<verse eid="EPH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Aulugulu, gili koleba asigida male melabiyo. Aubale. Gili koleba Saminilone hame amo ewebuba fadaba asigimale. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34">Lug 21.34</ref></char></note>Gili liboda degelo ibololo hano wolu nafasia, kagoamabiyo. Ausiale, gili koleba <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> gilifea wasigamesi, fogo memale.<verse eid="EPH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba Godene Asubane wasigafia ligiamo, gili koleba, gasa noolo Gasa bugo dobu amoda, aufia gulugulusia sodo amoda, aufia Asubane Noekenehe gine asigifea gagaseba olaboba melu amoda, gine gasa sodofea homale. Aulugulu, gine libo usu, Saminilofea henesia heafuba ligia, gasa selabia dedaleba melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:17">Kol 3.17</ref></char></note>Aufia, hilia sunia, kegele suniane, gilihe Nao Godefea henelu sulu selesiamo, nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone wi saabia ligia selaba melale.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe inolo ido dulu labe amone saaba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 5:5">1Fid 5.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili koleba, Kelisomo gine Saminilo bulebuba hilisefia, gili gine geleba sisa melale.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3.18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Fid 3.1</ref></char>
    </note>Idele gili, doma. Gilihe Saminilo sisa adoguba, gainodali sisa melale. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:3">1Kld 11.3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:22">Efe 1.22</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Keliso E-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesene</char> guni labeguba, inolomo, idone guni labe. Sesemo, Kelisohe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char>. Amo Ene domala labe. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Sese e-mo Keliso sisa labe. Aubasu, kegele suniafealomo, idele gilida, gine gaino sisa melale.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3.19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Fid 3.7</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo gili, doma. Gili koleba, gine ido hamesemale. Kelisohe sese hamesefia, Ene miliyolumo efea sagoba ofelesia weaseluguba, gilida gine geamono aubasu hamesemale. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Dai 3.5</ref></char></note>Kelisohe sese <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi</char> aulu. Hanodai, Ene suludai amo alefasia, Ehe sese nuguma heelu. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:2">2Kld 11.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:22">Kol 1.22</ref></char></note>E alefasia, sesemo Ene si saabia, olegi yafalaga melesi gadefalumo, nuguma baalu ulenoda male, agogolelu ulenoda male, goga baaluda male koleba, elalelu ligia, heleba daaluda male, Ene olegia <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> degeba melesi aulu. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Aubasu, inolo gili koleba, gine domala hameseloguba, gine geamonomo hamesemale. Inolohe ene ido koleba hamesefemo, seale, ene meleba hamesefe. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Inolo ulenohe, ene domala ene meleba habolale. Aubale. Ehe ene domalafea naiyo mesia, nafuluba luba ado. Kelisohe Ene sesefea aubasu mololo. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Ninimo, Kelisone domala haisi haisiba lolu.<verse eid="EPH 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:24">Stt 2.24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mad 19.5</ref></char>
    </note>Godene bugohe eweguba solu dobu. <char style="qt">“Aulune, inolohe enaedai enaodai gadefia daafia, ene eamonodai kulisi, aalu domala ule adefe.”</char> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:7">MUU 19.7</ref></char></note>Ewene mugusilumo, olaibo bule koleba. Nene na hilisesumo, amo Kelisodai ene sesedai amone iminife. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Sulu na selabia mulu amone obegesiamo, gili inolo ule ulebamo, gine geamonofea hamesesiamo, gene meleba hameseloguba hamesemale. Aufia, idele gili koleba, gine gaino bulebuba hilisefia, e baaba momoleba melale.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Folohe faibeda enaeda enaoda ine mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Faibili gili, doma. Gili <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> alebaibune, gine gaodai, gaedai, sisa ligia, aine sulu kuliba malale. Enebamo, mana amo isolu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:20">Kis 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Lo 5.16</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe eweguba molomaleba solu dobu. <char style="qt">“Ga koleba, ge gaodai, gaedai, bulebuba hilisesia, aalu sisa ligia, aalu baaba momoleba melale.”</char> Enebamo, molomalu sulu sunia selabia mulu amone aleba ami, molomalu sulu aga iwi selefe ewefea, oloba huliale sulu gegoaba saaba ufulu dobu. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:20">Kis 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Lo 5.16</ref></char></note>Oloba huliale sulu amone ewe. <char style="qt">“Ga auba molosenaga, ga nafulu aselabia abia, helefealu iwi fogo selale miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3.21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:4">Sng 78.4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:6">Snd 22.6</ref></char>
    </note>Enaodali gili, doma. Gilihe gine faibiline asigi woba ofelesia, ilifea kanomesi molomabiyo. Aubale. Gili koleba, Saminilone si saabia, mana nafulu molosia, gilihe faibe nafuluba isosiamo, Godene sulu mana ilifea waleba melale.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe balu dabalu mololoda, biso ilida, ili amofea solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-23">Kol 3.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:9-10">Dai 2.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:18">1Fid 2.18</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Balu dabalu mololo faibili</char> gili, doma. Gili <char style="w">Keliso</char> sisa ligia, ene sulu kuliba aafegubasu, gili koleba, gine helefealu iwine biso ilida sisa ligia, ine sulu kuliba malale. Ili bulebuba hilisesia, ili baaba sagilisia, gine asigi muguba ofelesiale, ine sulu kuliba malale. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ge biso ga beaba labi fogo amosu, ehe ga heafuba bamesifia, dabalu nafulu molomabiyo. Aubale. Biso ga beabale labi fogo amida, ga dabalu nafulu molomale. Ga dabalu molosiamo, Godene hame kuliba maiyo asigisia, Kelisone balu dabalu molologulu ligia, ge dabalu moloba melale. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Aulugulu, gilihe heafuba koleba dabalu molomale. Gilihe inolone dabalu molosuba molomabiyo. Aubale. Gili Saminilone dabalu molosuba molomale. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kld 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:24-25">Kol 3.24-25</ref></char></note>Asigima. Inolo ulenohe dabalu nafulu molosenaga, e balu dabalu mololo faibenagada, me beega inolonagada, Saminilohe efea elebe nafulu meyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:1">Kol 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Lom 2.11</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, biso gili, doma. Gilida gine balu dabalu mololo faibilifea amogubasu mana nafulu molomale. Gili koleba, ili sagiliba ofa mana molomabiyo. Enebamo, gili eweguba asigiyo dobu. Ine biso <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi labe ogo, E-mo, hamagane gine biso labe. E alefasia, idele inolo suniane mana osolasiamo, imini ule aiba osolalo.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigidubulu idele inolohe asubanefealo yobosiamo ewene kaeyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Samodosia, na eweguba selesu. Gili Saminilofea kulifia ligia, gili koleba Ene kiwigagalu wasolu koleba amofeada kulifia ligia, kiwigaafia kalugamale. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Lom 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:4">2Kld 10.4</ref></char></note>Godene yobolo kegele sunia kakama. Ausimo, gili auba kakafia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanehe</char> gili yogoleba gegeba yaasi, gili kiwigaafia kalugaeyodolu alebaiyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 5:8-9">1Fid 5.8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nafuluba asigima. Nini belagusiamo, idele inolodai gisa disuale. Aubale. Ninihe gisa disumo, yasilo nooloda, biso nooloda, aufia, helefealu nigiligagalu ewene wida solu ilida, aufia, asubane wolu kiwida, anakiwine kiwigagalu usu alebaibu amoda, ninihe ili galiba gisa diaba yaasu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Aulune, gili koleba, Godene yobolo kegele sunia kakama. Ausi, hilia wolu adesi, gili waminibale ligia, gisa iluwaba miliyobafe. Auba ligia, kegele sunia moloba samodofia, gili aso kiwigaafiasu yoba miliyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Ais 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59.17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1Des 5.8</ref></char>
    </note>Aulune, gili koleba, kiwigaafia kalugamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 6:14">Seale sulu sodo amo, homegia madibu amaleba dofamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 6:14">Aufia, gili koleba, mana isolumone, gine hamesa wakamale.<verse eid="EPH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Lom 10.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealone</char> awalu sulu nafulu saeyo maiyone madenefia miliyone, gine emofea samaga efolo adoba difasia melale.<verse eid="EPH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Aufia, amo sunia gegoafia, gili koleba <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> mana amomo, biyo subulu sefia melale. Biyo subulu amo sefia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanene</char> yalo de waiyada odesimo, gilihe sunia ususia kaeyodolu miliyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:12">Hib 4.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char> amo, habuga saligamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="EPH 6:17">Aufia, gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> helebesi semale. Amo Godene sulu.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:1">Lug 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:2">Kol 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:17">1Des 5.17</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenedai</char> kulifia ligia, fogo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, haaliba ligia, E gili sagoba homesi selaba melale. Auba hilisesia, si kolafia mela. Hilia sunia <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> sagoba ofelesia, kiwi sanebale, Godedai sulu selaba melale.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19-20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.19-20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:20">2Kld 5.20</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:9">Flm 1.9</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, gili koleba, ne-ba Godedai sulu eweguba saamale. Ene sulu ne mofeyo saabia homesi, gilihe Edai sulu saamale. Auba ausi, nahe sagililo mana dufa dafogofasia, idele inolofea awalu sulu nafulune mugusilu fadaba asigimesine saaba meyobasu. Dibolo iwi ligia, na mugusilu amone ulufaba saeyone mofeyo lolu. <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers in armor" file="HK00197B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1954, 1967, 1972, 1995." ref="6.10-17">Godene yobolo kegele sunia kakafia mela.</figure><verse eid="EPH 6:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elosia, hawiyoba sulu selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">HD 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol 4.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Dim 4.12</ref></char>
    </note>Digikusu e inigia, ehe gilifea na molosumo sunia fadaba saeyobafe. Digikusu e nine hameselu nelewo koleba ligia, Saminilone dabalu fedoba sefia mololo labe. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nahe e gili labea malalesumo, gilihe ene sulu dobelesia, nini iwi lolumone fadaba asigimesi malalesu. Amohe gine libo kiwigaaba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ne damenedali, gili <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> miliyobafe. Nao Godedai Saminilo Yesu Kelisodaihe gilifea hamesesia, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kiwigaaba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Idele inolo sunia, nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisoda afelesiale, hameseba alebaibu ili amofeamo, Godehe kanuluba ofolo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 6:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="6.24" /><verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>